user_template:
Analyze this poultry farm sync report and return a structured risk and recommendation assessment.

Farm ID: {farm_id}
Owner ID: {owner_id}
Sync Timestamp: {sync_timestamp}

Production Data:
- Flock size: {flock_size} birds
- Average weight: {average_weight_kg} kg
- Egg production: {egg_production_count} units
- Mortality rate: {mortality_rate_pct}%
- Feed conversion ratio: {feed_conversion_ratio}
- Active health alerts: {health_alert_count}
- Alert details: {health_alerts}

Return a JSON object with this exact structure:
{
  "risk_level": "low | medium | high",
  "summary": "<one sentence operational summary>",
  "recommendations": ["<action 1>", "<action 2>"],
  "predicted_yield_kg": <number or null>,
  "alerts_requiring_action": ["<alert description>"]
}
